# An allow-list: the build sees nothing but what is re-included below, so a
# publishing token, an env file, .git or a worktree never leaves the checkout.
# Keep it in step with the Dockerfile's COPY lines (tests/test_live_image.py).
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
!RELEASING.md
!ROADMAP.md
!SKILL.md
!server.json
!src
!scripts
!tests
!.github
# Inside those, still never: caches, and anything shaped like a secret.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/.mcpregistry_*
